{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s001", "text": "你好，今天的会议改到下午3点半开始。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.246, "n_samples": 77913, "proc_s": 1.1123, "rtf": 0.3426, "samples_sha256": "dfa85eedd6c3c859343ea22a55aef245961ef4c7b221439f2bb0ce1bce9797fd"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s002", "text": "我刚买了一部新的iPhone，用起来很顺手。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.619, "n_samples": 86848, "proc_s": 1.3878, "rtf": 0.3835, "samples_sha256": "41550587329fee85b9561b5cbbcfecec19a7d2d053a6da6403f83e9cc1471ec2"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s003", "text": "这件衣服打折以后只要128元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.684, "n_samples": 64411, "proc_s": 0.7614, "rtf": 0.2837, "samples_sha256": "aa1a1f7120e2edd2538e807c7fdef2f6e556837c2b13f82d2bcbf96e7047bdab"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s004", "text": "我们约在2026年10月20日见面吧。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.728, "n_samples": 65465, "proc_s": 0.7669, "rtf": 0.2811, "samples_sha256": "5dd22aa3e8b2b5f9179cfe2a35fca4d48db1d26daf601d481c769c85f0e4e7ed"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s005", "text": "请把报告在周五之前发给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.262, "n_samples": 54288, "proc_s": 0.6609, "rtf": 0.2922, "samples_sha256": "c5de48fcdc7be240166e2d67e6b4242dcbc392f771db8f54c5cf3eb8cce4a491"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s006", "text": "现在的AI工具越来越好用了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.418, "n_samples": 58030, "proc_s": 0.8465, "rtf": 0.3501, "samples_sha256": "ea39bc933baa656b340e1ff67d61fb048bad065b3d36c7a76218cc21da22fc02"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s007", "text": "你的航班几点起飞？我记得是早上8点20分。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.661, "n_samples": 87869, "proc_s": 1.1305, "rtf": 0.3088, "samples_sha256": "655a6f8a55862520bf7119167f27af7b4984aab2d8e64604753c30c9445bd271"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s008", "text": "这个月的电费一共是356块钱。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.889, "n_samples": 69339, "proc_s": 0.7992, "rtf": 0.2766, "samples_sha256": "ea40e16aa4cbb6398e8a423955e9a4db4ddb299ac66d82bbf50e2f0244c889b2"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s009", "text": "我住在3楼，电梯就在门口右边。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.913, "n_samples": 69907, "proc_s": 1.0767, "rtf": 0.3697, "samples_sha256": "ba063f5f463d0005d19d0866373716bb4032dea92a40258b95136c3cc20309a6"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s010", "text": "他每天跑步5公里，已经坚持了两年。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.07, "n_samples": 73675, "proc_s": 1.0022, "rtf": 0.3265, "samples_sha256": "2762fe1ae83c4e881100c98ef63d10ee04d56dc1c86da7f088241123e673a9fe"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s011", "text": "下周一我们要去上海出差。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.115, "n_samples": 50758, "proc_s": 0.6357, "rtf": 0.3006, "samples_sha256": "c46745d8554cec93de984542521d54426038a3bf81a1eb727447f4c252fe4d73"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s012", "text": "你能帮我订一张明天去北京的高铁票吗？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.863, "n_samples": 68722, "proc_s": 0.7949, "rtf": 0.2776, "samples_sha256": "0240aee58330afb7cbdea1bc49d940ee55a3dad802df85bd6f1cdf941de782b3"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s013", "text": "这家餐厅的评分是4.8分，值得一试。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.229, "n_samples": 77487, "proc_s": 1.0556, "rtf": 0.3269, "samples_sha256": "90970166f50588d84775f9ec927bed1ca302ccacee7f17bc0b080a4b00c74597"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s014", "text": "我的手机号是13812345678，有事打给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.019, "n_samples": 96458, "proc_s": 1.2801, "rtf": 0.3185, "samples_sha256": "c65d887003f155ded5fa4eb3b5ae43370917dfcefbcf249f1008e7b51ef06828"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s015", "text": "今年公司的销售额增长了15%。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.845, "n_samples": 68276, "proc_s": 0.9539, "rtf": 0.3353, "samples_sha256": "3cc6e95b0a604cfcf499b9901a3aedcf06401a1942bb32741e2e6d7284b62c47"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s016", "text": "孩子们放学以后在公园里踢足球。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.572, "n_samples": 61736, "proc_s": 0.7218, "rtf": 0.2806, "samples_sha256": "ece54e3c5a14c9f7a03f3ae8ba7ed96835907448c86b89c2f4461ff47ec2ee27"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s017", "text": "我用微信给你转了2000块，记得查收。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.057, "n_samples": 73375, "proc_s": 1.0059, "rtf": 0.329, "samples_sha256": "d01ca960559b86a7b1d7c1bc89a75c624e9964c06af1d5c98dd7150fff3737fe"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s018", "text": "天气预报说明天最高气温32度。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.772, "n_samples": 66528, "proc_s": 0.7702, "rtf": 0.2778, "samples_sha256": "6aa0ff4eb4dfedb27207367ed2fdd9a01dd6e87dd063f3aebf3b26ed3af4a7be"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s019", "text": "请问洗手间在哪里？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 1.654, "n_samples": 39691, "proc_s": 0.5164, "rtf": 0.3122, "samples_sha256": "7496f5a0a4c02c138435dd60b160a2b8a927bf49b9fde76484770e41ed8f2af8"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s020", "text": "我们的Zoom会议链接已经发到群里了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.047, "n_samples": 73123, "proc_s": 1.0954, "rtf": 0.3595, "samples_sha256": "0e2a230330e29d9c14971818dd7501204ce57bf98ecaafe588d007af5e76172e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s021", "text": "这本书我看了一半，故事特别精彩。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.808, "n_samples": 67395, "proc_s": 0.9915, "rtf": 0.3531, "samples_sha256": "296398eb97cdb5f38cebc00c89a78d66b5453c33496f8e31c95cb117e4544132"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s022", "text": "他的生日是5月4日，我们准备给他一个惊喜。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.435, "n_samples": 82442, "proc_s": 1.0983, "rtf": 0.3197, "samples_sha256": "19f0bea3590d2e821ad7ffddeb312f09a4bc9364a489a7a22294c273bc7a79c7"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s023", "text": "从这里打车到机场大概需要40分钟。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.945, "n_samples": 70669, "proc_s": 0.8057, "rtf": 0.2736, "samples_sha256": "062d830cd5f93321998fc37f548147e8efeb32acffb7a15a17afc6452ea1ee5b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s024", "text": "我刚下载了ChatGPT的新版本。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.244, "n_samples": 77866, "proc_s": 1.2, "rtf": 0.3699, "samples_sha256": "aae35c5b4ed302cc9cdaaee0a9ec1518c2c9d2865952e6b8981f830b805c490f"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s025", "text": "房租每个月涨了500元，真让人头疼。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.156, "n_samples": 75744, "proc_s": 1.1187, "rtf": 0.3545, "samples_sha256": "b190a3fa3b34a15e084619e3a5149adf49a540d3333b6272c58e41cdb48e4b0f"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s026", "text": "周末你想去看电影还是去爬山？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.517, "n_samples": 60396, "proc_s": 0.8463, "rtf": 0.3363, "samples_sha256": "ece8d97ac20aa90d4098287259f173c805e4e05a21c0d68b96c4a3ffdfa1c27a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s027", "text": "这台笔记本电脑的价格是6999元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.438, "n_samples": 82509, "proc_s": 0.9107, "rtf": 0.2649, "samples_sha256": "dd7e9f055b2d7705751231f4885fedc7f1df8c2125849e1cf3a2878d833e302f"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid52", "sentence_id": "s028", "text": "医生建议我每天喝8杯水。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 1.974, "n_samples": 47384, "proc_s": 0.5931, "rtf": 0.3004, "samples_sha256": "d915e2112ab3d436a0bd0249fafdc4110ddc9470e25c199e8e646b2e95a8a6de"}
